  "imprint_register_title": "Company Register",
  "imprint_register_body": "Local Court Regensburg HRB 2966\nVAT ID No. DE 128580122\n\nContent responsible: Dr. Stefan Brand\nAuthorized representative: Dr. Stefan Brand",
  "imprint_disclaimer_title": "Disclaimer",
  "imprint_disclaimer_body": "We make every effort to provide accurate and complete information on this website, but we assume no liability or guarantee for the timeliness, accuracy or completeness of the information provided. This also applies to all external links to which this website refers directly or indirectly. We are not responsible for the content of external websites accessed via such links. All information on prices, product texts and images is provided without warranty; errors and technical changes reserved.",
